This license exists because someone looked at
OpenComputers — a mod about Lua-programmable robots
that could mine, build, and automate your Minecraft
world — and thought:

    "You know what this needs? Linux."

They were wrong. They have always been wrong.
This license is a formal record of that wrongness.

